      "seed": 1068085913,
      "version": 1455,
      "versionNonce": 2077245591,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793863385275,
      "created": 1793848901736,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "那不就只有这两张是业务表，其余全部都是为了\n实现数据同步的工作表了，这个设计太重了",
      "fontSize": 138.03599393965789,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "那不就只有这两张是业务表，其余全部都是为了\n实现数据同步的工作表了，这个设计太重了",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NHbfffPLoKBS3Sa67Yd5G",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2047.5675640249606,
      "y": 9227.90910707507,
      "width": 1210.6667073567714,
      "height": 272.4000091552735,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ay",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 788100919,
      "version": 477,
      "versionNonce": 691314615,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793852680340,
      "created": 1793849801452,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "source_version的含义：源端主数据记录的版本\n号，代表这条业务数据在源端被修改了多少次\n新纪录创建时：source_version = 1\n每次更新后： source_version += 1",
      "fontSize": 54.4800018310547,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "source_version的含义：源端主数据记录的版本号，代表这条业务数据在源端被修改了多少次\n新纪录创建时：source_version = 1\n每次更新后： source_version += 1",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
