    {
      "id": "PLeFTq9_HGmGT5mGiF2TL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7480,
      "y": 11100,
      "width": 3485.677734375,
      "height": 2096.2635114454647,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b01",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1875027383,
      "version": 1371,
      "versionNonce": 1888852183,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "o_skGshC07rpJ0xnVxvm-",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1793863699525,
      "created": 1793850060121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": true,
      "text": "源端source_version变更时机：\nMockSapServiceImpl.save()方法：\n\n1、锁定流时钟（行锁）\nmapper.lockStream(type.name()) - > select sequence_no from stream_clock for update;\n\n2、查询当前版本号\nmapper.selectVersion(type.name(),key) -> select source_version from master_record where business_key = ?\n查不到 -> current = 0(新纪录)\n查得到 -> current = version(已有记录)\n\n3、乐观锁校验\nif（current != expectedVersion） throw SOURCE_VERSION_CONFLICT -> 防止并发写入时相互覆盖\n\n4、source_version + 1\nSourceRecordDTO record = new SourceRecordDTO(..., current + 1, ...)\n\n5、写入master_record(upsert)\nmapper.upsertRecord(type, key, current + 1, json)  -> \n\n6、写入change_event(事件流)\nmapper.insertChange(type,sequence+1,json) -> record_json内部包含sourceVersion:currnt+1\n\n7、推进流时钟序号\nmapper.updateSequence(type, sequence + 1)",
      "fontSize": 67.08043236625487,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "源端source_version变更时机：\nMockSapServiceImpl.save()方法：\n\n1、锁定流时钟（行锁）\nmapper.lockStream(type.name()) - > select sequence_no from stream_clock for update;\n\n2、查询当前版本号\nmapper.selectVersion(type.name(),key) -> select source_version from master_record where business_key = ?\n查不到 -> current = 0(新纪录)\n查得到 -> current = version(已有记录)\n\n3、乐观锁校验\nif（current != expectedVersion） throw SOURCE_VERSION_CONFLICT -> 防止并发写入时相互覆盖\n\n4、source_version + 1\nSourceRecordDTO record = new SourceRecordDTO(..., current + 1, ...)\n\n5、写入master_record(upsert)\nmapper.upsertRecord(type, key, current + 1, json)  -> \n\n6、写入change_event(事件流)\nmapper.insertChange(type,sequence+1,json) -> record_json内部包含sourceVersion:currnt+1\n\n7、推进流时钟序号\nmapper.updateSequence(type, sequence + 1)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5q4_5Mh61lu2Xvjzv2jqX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2038.9012012625114,
      "y": 11104.575785265302,
      "width": 4110.66650390625,
      "height": 1137.3352050781416,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b02",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 31295481,
      "version": 833,
      "versionNonce": 167468535,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793852680340,
      "created": 1793850698917,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "目标端source_version变更时机：\nMasterDataPersistenceServiceImpl.write() 方法：\n\n1、从源端拉取record_json\n    -> 解析得到sourceRecordDTO（含sourceVersion）\n\n2、组装目标实体\n    MasterDataAssembler.costCenter(record, hash) → target.setSourceVersion(record.sourceVersion())\n\n3、批量upsert到目录表\ncostCenters.batchUpsert(records,repair) -> \n",
      "fontSize": 75.82234700520944,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "目标端source_version变更时机：\nMasterDataPersistenceServiceImpl.write() 方法：\n\n1、从源端拉取record_json\n    -> 解析得到sourceRecordDTO（含sourceVersion）\n\n2、组装目标实体\n    MasterDataAssembler.costCenter(record, hash) → target.setSourceVersion(record.sourceVersion())\n\n3、批量upsert到目录表\ncostCenters.batchUpsert(records,repair) -> \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
