      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793885759551,
      "created": 1793885721328,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2、分布式任务调度：基于 XXL-JOB 实现同步任务的定时触发与运行追踪，结合数据库租约、心跳续租及 fencing token协调多实\n例执行，通过请求幂等、退避重试与人工补偿实现失败恢复及可视化运维。",
      "fontSize": 71.99999999999999,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2、分布式任务调度：基于 XXL-JOB 实现同步任务的定时触发与运行追踪，结合数据库租约、心跳续租及 fencing token协调多实例执行，通过请求幂等、退避重试与人工补偿实现失败恢复及可视化运维。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "y1E6I9znxfeHfSxN6-4yC",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -22100,
      "y": 2480,
      "width": 1620,
      "height": 900,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4A",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 553156345,
      "version": 88,
      "versionNonce": 1870320215,
      "isDeleted": false,
