      "text": "针对消费者可能出现重复投递的问题，通过工单\nID + 通知类型生成业务唯一键，在发送记录表中\n进行重复校验。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "针对消费者可能出现重复投递的问题，通过工单ID + 通知类型生成业务唯一键，在发送记录表中进行重复校验。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CmnSzc1bhQmlHrAvOC7Cg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -28600,
      "y": -1520,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1426474201,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 1336085879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793888744862,
      "created": 1793888736360,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "配合测试定位过一次线上工单重复通知问题，最终\n发现消费者异常重试后重复发送，增加发送状态校\n验后解决。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "配合测试定位过一次线上工单重复通知问题，最终发现消费者异常重试后重复发送，增加发送状态校验后解决。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AsFeKkBuoec6ESy-f5amI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -29920,
      "y": -820,
      "width": 793.4039306640625,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1629790009,
      "version": 36,
      "versionNonce": 1800711223,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793888896620,
      "created": 1793888894549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "库存查询性能优化：针对数据量较高的材料总览和\n仓库实时库存页面，引入Redis缓存层。设计并实\n现了缓存键规则与失效策略，将热点数据的查询响\n应时间从 ~200ms 降低至 ~10ms，并通过缓存空\n值预防了缓存穿透问题。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "库存查询性能优化：针对数据量较高的材料总览和仓库实时库存页面，引入Redis缓存层。设计并实现了缓存键规则与失效策略，将热点数据的查询响应时间从 ~200ms 降低至 ~10ms，并通过缓存空值预防了缓存穿透问题。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IkqZQqkzyejYFTshYjMwn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -29920,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1547690903,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 387739929,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793888999882,
      "created": 1793888998739,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "性能优化：针对核心查询接口慢查询问题，设计\nMySQL 联合索引、Redis 热点缓存、RabbitMQ\n异步化改造，拆分同步逻辑，参与完成方案设计与\n实施，接口平均响应时间由 800ms 降至\n120ms，数据库 QPS 下降 45%；",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "性能优化：针对核心查询接口慢查询问题，设计 MySQL 联合索引、Redis 热点缓存、RabbitMQ 异步化改造，拆分同步逻辑，参与完成方案设计与实施，接口平均响应时间由 800ms 降至 120ms，数据库 QPS 下降 45%；",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
